1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:04,733
[GENTLE MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:05,567 --> 00:00:06,700
What did you say?!

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,633
I know you have
a speech impediment,

4
00:00:09,633 --> 00:00:11,267
but I didn't know
you're also deaf.

5
00:00:11,267 --> 00:00:12,467
Right, Junifer?

6
00:00:13,667 --> 00:00:16,733
Don't call me by my full name
in this house!

7
00:00:17,667 --> 00:00:19,433
Are you going
to marry me or not?

8
00:00:20,733 --> 00:00:23,733
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

9
00:00:23,733 --> 00:00:25,400
[SCREAMS] Yes!

10
00:00:25,733 --> 00:00:28,733
Not too loud. They might think
I'm hurting you or something.

11
00:00:28,733 --> 00:00:30,167
I'll take it back
if you keep at it.

12
00:00:30,467 --> 00:00:32,300
No, you can't.

13
00:00:32,733 --> 00:00:34,200
[SCREAMS] Yes!

14
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,133
[SHERYN] No!

15
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:37,267
[BIRDS' FEATHERS FLAP AWAY]

16
00:00:37,267 --> 00:00:38,500
This can't be!

17
00:00:38,733 --> 00:00:40,567
Yes, it can!

18
00:00:40,767 --> 00:00:41,667
Look.

19
00:00:41,667 --> 00:00:43,567
[IMA] You're such a grinch.

20
00:00:43,567 --> 00:00:45,100
Can't you just be happy?

21
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,333
[CHUCKLES] Okay, great.

22
00:00:46,333 --> 00:00:49,133
I'll talk to my staff to look
for a wedding coordinator.

23
00:00:49,133 --> 00:00:52,133
Oh, Attorney,
we can't do that just yet.

24
00:00:52,667 --> 00:00:55,400
Because it's gonna be
a cursed wedding.

25
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,467
Someone from our family
just died.

26
00:00:58,733 --> 00:00:59,967
[PING] Fine.

27
00:00:59,967 --> 00:01:01,467
Then, I'll stay here
through our engagement.

28
00:01:01,467 --> 00:01:02,467
Hmm?!

29
00:01:02,467 --> 00:01:04,467
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

30
00:01:04,467 --> 00:01:05,433
[COUGHS]

31
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:07,400
We're going to live together?

32
00:01:08,433 --> 00:01:10,567
We didn't agree on that.

33
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:15,600
How will we know each other
if we don't live together?

34
00:01:22,100 --> 00:01:23,167
Okay?

35
00:01:26,067 --> 00:01:27,767
But we'll sleep
in different rooms.

36
00:01:31,067 --> 00:01:34,167
Ping, uh, sorry.
Could you excuse us?

37
00:01:34,167 --> 00:01:35,167
[HUFFS]

38
00:01:40,133 --> 00:01:41,300
Are you for real?

39
00:01:41,833 --> 00:01:44,100
Have you really
loosened up to June?

40
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:47,067
I don't think this is it.

41
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:51,700
[GENTLE MUSIC PLAYING]

42
00:01:52,367 --> 00:01:54,200
I'm only doing this
for Don Nato.

43
00:01:57,667 --> 00:01:58,633
Okay.

44
00:02:06,667 --> 00:02:13,667
[GENTLE MUSIC CONTINUES]
